The Rust crates compiled into Moonowl, and their licences

Every crate below is compiled into the Moonowl binary. Each licence text is
followed by the crates it covers, with the repository each one names. The
source of every crate is on crates.io at the version listed, except the Blitz
crates (blitz-*, dioxus-native, stylo_taffy) and Parley, which are built from
Moonowl's public forks: https://github.com/lhdjung/blitz and
https://github.com/lhdjung/parley.

